name=shoot
category=system
description=run the Shoot interactive shell or a script
usage=shoot [SCRIPT]
option=-h, --help    show this help
note=With no SCRIPT, start the interactive shell; otherwise run the script and exit with its status.
note=Unquoted arguments support *, ?, and bracket pathname patterns. Unmatched patterns remain literal.
note=Expanded vectors grow within the native 8 MiB argument budget; input lines remain bounded. See info shoot for details.
